OL,3,GNEWSAAmber wind warning issued as storm
OL,4,Asweeps in
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amber warning for wind has been
OL,7,Fissued for parts of Cumbria and the
OL,8,Fnorth-east of England as the region
OL,9,Fbraces itself for Storm Boelo.
OL,11,FHigh winds are expected to batter north
OL,12,Fand west Cumbria, including Carlisle,
OL,13,FWhitehaven and Alston and
OL,14,FNorthumberland, including Amble, Wooler
OL,15,Fand Seahouses.
OL,17,FThe Met Office warning is in place for
OL,18,F24 hours from 21:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
